    given-names: "Leonardo"
version: "0.1.0"
url: "https://github.com/Leonardo1952/federated-ids-temporal-adaptation"
license: MIT
abstract: "Code and scientific documentation for a leakage-controlled temporal evaluation of eight concept-drift adaptation strategies for federated intrusion detection in IIoT (TON_IoT and Gotham 2025; logistic regression and MLP; 160 plans). The MIT license covers the author-written material in this distribution; datasets and derived aggregates, states and calibrations are not included (see docs/artifacts.md)."
